## Claude-specific gotchas

- `.claude/` is a protected path: writes prompt in default and acceptEdits, go to the classifier in auto, and are denied in dontAsk. Allow rules do not pre-approve them.
- When you lead a session, do not invoke the pstack copies in `~/.claude/skills/` yourself; name them in a worker's brief (`docs/WORKERS.md`, pstack).
